('cmsq6fkc20004uxl47h52097z', 'Strategy', 'Stay ahead of your business competitors better by following what\'s original and new for the users. We do robust strategies that can perform better, we define your competition and target audie', '/uploads/process/strategy-01-jpg-bv-f295bbeaab8e.webp', 1, '2026-08-12 14:20:39.985', '2026-08-19 08:33:37.953', '#f59e0b', 'cmsq601c80000uxl4wrub7a30', 0),
('cmsq6gb8a0006uxl4hbjqqtcd', 'Design', 'Colour scheme, layout, sitemap, and style. We bring your brand to life with a one of a kind masterpiece, built just for you. We make your brand speak that tone up with the voice of your busin', '/uploads/process/design-02-jpg-bv-3fc1a2a86421.webp', 1, '2026-08-12 14:21:14.842', '2026-08-13 07:35:18.020', '#b7db3f', 'cmsq601c80000uxl4wrub7a30', 1),
('cmsq6h8ix0008uxl41pluwbaa', 'Development', 'We turn your ideas into a reality by going an extra mile with you. Your website is placed on a development server and you get to watch the whole process, live via our project management platf', '/uploads/process/develop-03-jpg-bv-1915cb3007d6.webp', 1, '2026-08-12 14:21:57.992', '2026-08-13 07:35:32.507', '#00d0b5', 'cmsq601c80000uxl4wrub7a30', 2),
('cmsq6ia8v000auxl4mspm3s8w', 'Support', 'This is where you go live, to the world. Marketing, Maintenance and Enhancements; we\'ll be at your side for the life of your site, so that you can stay focused on your customers.\",', '/uploads/process/support-04-jpg-bv-3c46c99b282d.webp', 1, '2026-08-12 14:22:46.879', '2026-08-13 07:34:22.819', '#ff9b4b', 'cmsq601c80000uxl4wrub7a30', 3);

