('cmsrgd39o0003ux6sbvgtgc3t', '/uploads/testimonial/no-image-1786692175588.png', 'Andrew Bridges', 'Director', 'South Coast Clearance Services Ltd', 'The website is beautifully done! Everything that needed attention has been addressed with great care. I\'m really pleased with the progress so far.', 1, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-18 13:54:25.830'),
