('cmsrgd39p0005ux6subjsfxxt', '/uploads/testimonial/no-image-1786692312293.png', 'Jonathan Bowles', 'Director', 'Bushido Doubler', 'The website is clean, simple, and fits perfectly for a startup. It covers all the essential needs without any complexity. Great job!', 3, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:25:13.758'),
