('cmsrgd39p0007ux6s2joyq4p5', '/uploads/testimonial/mathew_wildmen_1-1786692429449.jpg', 'Matthew Wildeman', 'Owner', 'MW Estate Planning', 'Visualytes have been doing my SEO for a number of months. I started on page 3 of Google but I\'m now on page 1 for all my key search terms. Nagendra Mishra has helped me understand the mystica', 5, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:27:11.341'),
('cmsrgd39p0008ux6ss83net8i', '/uploads/testimonial/steve-munson-1786692454652.jpg', 'Stephen J Munson', '', NULL, 'Nagendra and the Visualytes Team took on board our programming requirements of our new website, and reacted superbly, programming the website in a timely manner and implementing the tweaks to', 6, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:27:36.581'),
('cmsrgd39p0009ux6sg7mqimis', '/uploads/testimonial/foto-trendz-owner-1786692481255.png', 'Mark Vella', 'Foto Trendz Owner', NULL, 'I was introduced to Visualytes by a friend. I had a website produced by them. Their customer service has been amazing. They guided me through every step and I have already recommended them to', 7, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:28:02.418'),
