('cmsrgd39p000hux6so45qzx1v', '/uploads/testimonial/no-image-1786692638952.png', 'Dr. Abdoulie Sanneh', 'The Chair', 'TUVAA', 'The United Voice of African Associations is incredibly grateful to Visualytes for their continuous support. They created a professional website free of charge and continue to offer excellent ', 15, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:30:40.115'),
('cmsrgd39p000iux6svwxiimh9', '/uploads/testimonial/no-image-1786692653667.png', 'Beena Acharyav', 'Owner', 'Beena\'s Beauty Clinic', 'I was very impressed with the professionalism of the website development process. The team was always available to answer questions and I highly recommend their services.', 16, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:30:54.989'),
