('cmsrgd39p000kux6suzvyoazj', '/uploads/testimonial/no-image-1786692690321.png', 'Elias Ndiema', '', NULL, 'Without paid advertising I started getting good local clients from my website within two months. Excellent online presence work.', 18, 1, '2026-08-13 11:46:26.883', '2026-08-14 07:31:31.985'),
